# SWAT 4 — Arabic Localization (التعريب)
# File: SwatGui.ara (Arabic)
# Encoding: UTF-8 (for browser-based reimplementation)
# 
# This file contains Arabic translations of SWAT 4's UI strings.
# Based on SwatGui.spa (Spanish) and SwatGui.int (English) localization files.
# 
# Format: Section/Key=TranslatedValue
# %1, %2 = placeholders for dynamic values
# [c=RRGGBB] = color codes
# [b]...[\b] = bold
# [k=KeyName] = key binding

